  m_text: 'W - Foward A- Left S - Backward D - Right

    

    ESC - menu

    Lclick
    - use selected item

    Rclick - zoom in

    Shift - sprint

    Ctrl -
    crouch

    Space Bar - jump

    E - interact

    Q - drop / throw selected
    item

    R - remove battery from selected item

    G - radio

    Mouse
    Wheel - scroll through inventory '
